     这个 reframe 把 novelty 锚点从 method → empirical findings + theoretical analysis，避开 \"incremental over XGrammar\" 攻击线。\n      补充工作：(a) 更深的 violation pattern 分析（per-relation type、per-document length、per-entity ambiguity）；(b) 与 GoLLIE 等 code-generation IE 的 violation 对比（d063 已有初步数据）；(c) 理论部分扩展 decidability taxonomy 为 formal framework。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a53a4254-c6cc-4766-82ff-85c54fd106d5","total_cost_usd":0.44231125,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42795,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":5241,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":42795,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":5241,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42795,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":42795},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":37757,"outputTokens":26,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.037887,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":5241,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":42795,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.40442425,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"fc31da95-3736-49f5-9a8d-34118d051518"}
